Licensing for this repository
=============================

This repository holds several kinds of material. They are licensed
separately.

1. Specification text and schemas: CC BY 4.0

   The RCAN specification text and schemas in this repository are
   licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
   License (SPDX: CC-BY-4.0). This covers:

     spec/             specification text
     schemas/          JSON Schema and OpenAPI files
     public/schemas/   the published copies of those schemas
     src/pages/spec/   the specification snapshots published on
                       rcan.dev

   The full legal code is in LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt and at
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

2. Reference SDKs: MIT, in their own repositories

   The reference SDKs are not in this repository. rcan-py
   (https://github.com/RobotRegistryFoundation/rcan-py) and rcan-ts
   (https://github.com/RobotRegistryFoundation/rcan-ts) are published
   under the MIT License, as their PyPI and npm package metadata state.

3. Scripts, tests and fixtures: Apache 2.0

   The scripts, tests and test fixtures in this repository are licensed
   under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (SPDX: Apache-2.0). This
   covers:

     scripts/          conformance checkers, case files and other tools
     tests/            the test suites
     fixtures/         test vectors

   The full text is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt and at
   https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

4. Site and registry code, profiles and configuration: Apache 2.0

   The rcan.dev site and registry code, the robot profiles and this
   repository's build and CI configuration are licensed under the
   Apache License, Version 2.0 (SPDX: Apache-2.0). This covers:

     src/              the rcan.dev site, except src/pages/spec/
     functions/        the rcan.dev API and registry functions
     migrations/       registry database migrations
     schema/           the registry database schema
     public/           everything except public/schemas/ and the
                       files listed in section 6
     profiles/         robot configuration profiles
     .github/          workflows, issue templates and actions

   It also covers the configuration files at the top of the
   repository: package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, astro.config.mjs,
   tailwind.config.mjs, tsconfig.json, vitest.config.ts,
   wrangler.toml, .gitignore, CNAME and CODEOWNERS.

   The full text is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt and at
   https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

5. Documentation: CC BY 4.0

   The documentation in this repository is licensed under the
   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
   (SPDX: CC-BY-4.0). This covers:

     docs/             documentation, governance and design notes

   It also covers the documents at the top of the repository:
   README.md, CHANGELOG.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md,
   VERSIONING.md and CLAUDE.md.

   The full legal code is in LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt and at
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

6. Not licensed by this file

   This file grants no licence for:

     public/favicon.svg, public/og.svg, public/badges/
                       logos and visual identity, which the draft
                       charter (docs/governance/
                       robot-registry-foundation.md) keeps as all
                       rights reserved
     .wrangler/        local development state
     anything not listed in sections 1 to 5
